" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Awareness_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Magic Awareness Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Magic_Awareness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Magic_Awareness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Magic_Awareness_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Magic_Awareness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Magic_Awareness_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Magic_Awareness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Awareness Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Magic_Awareness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Magic_Awareness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Magic_Awareness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Awareness_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Magic Awareness Aura (Condition)\">Magic Awareness Aura</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Radius:&nbsp;3 m (10 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠Radius:&nbsp;3 m (10 ft)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>A nearby barbarian is visualising the Weave.</li>\n<li>Adds a <span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/46px-D4_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/62px-D4_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/D4_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> 1d4 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>, as long as they stay within 3 m (10 ft) of the barbarian.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The in-game description is inaccurate. It says, \"The barbarian and all creatures within 3 m (10 ft) add their proficiency bonus to saving throws against spells.\" In reality, the bonus is 1d4 and it applies to <em>all</em> saving throws, not just against spells.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Magic_Awareness\">Sources of Magic Awareness</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Awareness\" title=\"Magic Awareness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Magic_Awareness_Icon.webp/30px-Magic_Awareness_Icon.webp, 